Model and dataset notices
=========================

The MIT grant covers the original PyFeat-Live application code. Third-party
libraries retain their own licenses. Downloaded detector and visualization
weights, research datasets, and optional generator assets have separate
terms; the application license does not grant their providers' rights.

See LICENSE-MODELS.md for the application-specific notice and links to the
classic-v1, multitask-v2, and dataset notices. Existing valid model license
grants are not revoked by this clarification.
